spec MatchCancel.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK ResourcePartition NoLateReady ReadyOnce
reach CancelAwaitUntrack | peer-present
reach RetryBeforeOldCleanup | peer-present
reach StaleAfterRetry | peer-present
reach NormalHandoff | pre-signaling
reach TerminalClosed | pre-signaling
run pre-signaling | StartWithPeer=FALSE
run peer-present | StartWithPeer=TRUE

spec MatchCancel.tla
check PROPERTIES CleanupEventually
run cleanup-pre-signaling | StartWithPeer=FALSE
run cleanup-peer-present | StartWithPeer=TRUE
